      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "bb\nHIGH COURT OF DELHI: NEW DELHI\nDELHI HIGHER JUDICIAL SERVICE PRELIMINARY EXAMINATION-2026\n\nDate: 28.07.2026\nNOTICE\n\nIt is to notify all concerned that the Model Answer Keys of Question Paper\nBooklets of all the Series, i.e. A, B, C and D regarding Delhi Higher Judicial Service\nPreliminary Examination, 2026 held on 26.07.2026 have been prepared and the same are\nattached herewith.\n\nIf any candidate has any objection regarding the aforesaid Model Answer Keys,\nhe/she may file his/her objection(s) through online mode ONLY on the link provided on\nthe official website of this Court within 03 days from the date of this Notice, i.e.,\n31.07.2026 (upto 05.00 PM). Objections received thereafter shall not be entertained.\nAny representation regarding objections received by any other mode will not be\nentertained. It is clarified that the candidates are restricted from choosing the same\nanswer option as given in the Model Answer Keys while raising the Objection. It is\nmandatory for candidates to give justification/reasons in support of their objection(s).\nB\nI,\\\n\n(Arun Bhardwaj)\nRegistrar General",
